        prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/63ace896bba72dd95b1823861b5b9936be9cf066/models/2026-delphi10000-anomalocaris-canadensis-turing-wavelength-s0.py#L234-L266> .
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-anomalocaris-canadensis-turing-wavelength-s0-morphometric-validation-3> a pk:EvidenceItem ;
