            <https://doi.org/10.1666/13-067> .
    <https://doi.org/10.1007/BF00289234> dct:title "A theory of biological pattern formation" .
    <https://doi.org/10.1016/0022-5193(79)90042-0> dct:title "Simple chemical reaction systems with limit cycle behaviour" .
    <https://doi.org/10.1038/nature09920> dct:title "A giant Ordovician anomalocaridid" .
    <https://doi.org/10.1038/nature10689> dct:title "Acute vision in the giant Cambrian predator Anomalocaris and the origin of compound eyes" .
    <https://doi.org/10.1073/pnas.1015302108> dct:title "A dynamical model of ommatidial crystal formation" .
    <https://doi.org/10.1098/rstb.1952.0012> dct:title "The chemical basis of morphogenesis" .
